<wpt lat="37.937404" lon="-107.811759"><name>Coffee: Telluride</name><desc>Mile 0. Same as day 2.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.946745" lon="-107.836350"><name>Fuel: Shell</name><desc>Mile 1.5.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.994533" lon="-108.000968"><name>Fuel: Sawpit Mercantile</name><desc>Mile 12.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.151412" lon="-107.757482"><name>Coffee: Ridgway, first pass</name><desc>Mile 39. Cimarron Coffee, 380 Sherman, 7 to 4, 970-626-5858; Colorado Girl, 620 Clinton, from 6:30, 970-626-5282.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.151939" lon="-107.761448"><name>Lunch: Ridgway</name><desc>Mile 45.2. Eatery 66, 520 Sherman, 11:30 to 2, closed Wed, 970-626-5901; True Grit Cafe, 123 N Lena, from 11, closed Wed, 970-626-5739; Kate's Place, 615 Clinton, 7 to 2, closed Tue, 970-626-9800.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.151135" lon="-107.748017"><name>Fuel: Ridgway. LAST FOR 91 MILES</name><desc>Mile 46. Conoco at the US 550 corner.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.192454" lon="-107.645096"><name>Check: Left onto Owl Creek Pass Road (CR 8)</name><desc>Mile 54.9. Burn from here to mile 68.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.413730" lon="-107.526273"><name>Way out: Right onto US 50</name><desc>Mile 90.2. Pavement. Newberry's in Cimarron lists fuel (82119 E US 50): off our line, not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.404535" lon="-107.407264"><name>Way out: DECIDE: right onto Alpine Plateau Road</name><desc>Mile 98.8. FR 868 closed, or wet? Stay on US 50 to CO 149: about 31 mi longer, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.175123" lon="-107.347495"><name>Check: Left onto Alpine Road (FR 868)</name><desc>Mile 120.1. Elk Fire closure in 2026: check. Right at 121.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.179259" lon="-107.291342"><name>Way out: Right onto CO 149</name><desc>Mile 125.7. Pavement.</desc></wpt>
